(JAIPUR - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(A two-player trading game. Players are merchants in Jaipur. They collect goods and) Tj T*
(sell them for tokens; the richest merchant at the end of a round wins a seal of) Tj T*
(excellence. Two seals win the game.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Put 3 camel cards face up in the market and fill it with 2 cards from the deck \(5) Tj T*
(cards in total\). Deal 5 cards to each player. Players put their camels face up in) Tj T*
(front of them as their herd. Sort the goods tokens by type, highest values on top.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Do one of these two actions:) Tj T*
(1. Take cards:) Tj T*
(- take several goods by exchanging the same number of cards \(goods from hand or) Tj T*
(   camels\), or) Tj T*
(- take 1 single good, or) Tj T*
(- take all camels from the market.) Tj T*
(2. Sell cards: sell any number of cards of one type of goods and take that many tokens) Tj T*
(   from the top) Tj T*
(   of that pile.) Tj T*
(Refill the market to 5 cards from the deck after taking.) Tj T*
ET
