(SELLING RULES) Tj T*
(- Diamonds, gold and silver can only be sold 2 or more at a time.) Tj T*
(- Selling 3, 4 or 5 or more cards at once earns a bonus token of that size.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HAND LIMIT) Tj T*
(At the end of your turn you may hold at most 7 cards. Camels in your herd do not) Tj T*
(count.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF A ROUND) Tj T*
(The round ends immediately when 3 types of goods tokens are gone, or when the deck is) Tj T*
(empty and the market can not be refilled. The player with the most camels gets the) Tj T*
(camel token \(5 rupees\). The player with the most rupees wins the round and a seal of) Tj T*
(excellence. On a tie, the player with more bonus tokens wins, then the player with) Tj T*
(more goods tokens.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNING) Tj T*
(The first player with 2 seals of excellence wins the game.) Tj T*
ET
